<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
    Privacy manifest. Apple requires one for the "required reason" APIs the binary references.

    The categories below were not guessed: they are the ones the archived release binary actually
    references, checked with nm over app/build .../StreetComplete.app/StreetComplete.
      NSUserDefaults  - OBJC_CLASS_$_NSUserDefaults, from multiplatform-settings and the
                        AppleLanguages write that applies the language setting
      stat/fstat/lstat - file timestamps, from SQLite and kotlinx-io
      statfs/fstatfs   - free space, from SQLite
    NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategorySystemBootTime is deliberately NOT declared: sysctlbyname is
    referenced, but the "kern.boottime" selector string does not appear in the binary, so boot time
    is not being read. Re-check with nm if the dependency set changes.

    NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes is empty: nothing is sent to a server this project controls. Edits
    go to OpenStreetMap under the user's own account, and the statistics endpoint is only ever read
    from (a GET carrying the user's own OSM id). The App Store Connect privacy questionnaire is the
    authoritative answer, though, and is the account holder's to complete - treat this as the
    starting point for it, not as the final word.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>NSPrivacyTracking</key>
    <false/>
    <key>NSPrivacyTrackingDomains</key>
    <array/>
    <key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes</key>
    <array/>
    <key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes</key>
    <array>
        <dict>
            <key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
            <string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults</string>
            <key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
            <array>
                <!-- CA92.1: access info from the app itself -->
                <string>CA92.1</string>
            </array>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
            <string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp</string>
            <key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
            <array>
                <!-- C617.1: timestamps of files inside the app container -->
                <string>C617.1</string>
            </array>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
            <string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryDiskSpace</string>
            <key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
            <array>
                <!-- E174.1: check there is space to write, before writing -->
                <string>E174.1</string>
            </array>
        </dict>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
